# Production build settings.
#
# The SPA and the API are served from the same Vercel deployment, so the client
# talks to a relative "/api" path and no absolute URL is needed. Leaving
# VITE_API_URL unset is the correct default.
#
# Only set this if you host the backend on a DIFFERENT domain, e.g.:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api-host.example.com/api
